--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY NOTICES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project incorporates or is derived from material from the following
third-party sources.

1. face-api.js (pretrained model weights)
   Files: resources/weights/*
   Source: face-api.js by justadudewhohacks (https://github.com/justadudewhohacks/face-api.js)
   License: MIT License
   Also used at runtime via CDN (face-api.js@0.22.2), unmodified.

2. three.js
   Used at runtime via CDN (three@0.160.0), unmodified, not vendored into this repo.
   Source: https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js
   License: MIT License

3. HDR environment maps
   Files: resources/environments/aquarium.hdr, lightStudio.hdr, neonStudio.hdr, nightSky.hdr
   Source: Poly Haven (https://polyhaven.com)
   License: CC0 1.0 Universal (no attribution required; credited here as a courtesy)

4. Signed distance function formulas
   Files: shaderChunks/shapeChunk.js (_signedDistanceSphere, _signedDistanceBox,
   _signedDistanceTorus, _smoothMin, and related helpers)
   Adapted from the distance function and smooth-minimum articles by Inigo Quilez
   (https://iquilezles.org/articles/distfunctions/, https://iquilezles.org/articles/smin/)
   Reimplemented with this project's own naming and structure.

5. Glass shading technique
   File: shaderChunks/surfaceChunk.js (_clusterShading, _clusterRefractedColor,
   _clusterTraceInterior, _exitRefractedRay, and related helpers)
   Adapted from a Shadertoy glass shader by mmalex, created 2013-12-09
   (https://www.shadertoy.com/view/XsSGDh), including the interior raymarch / refraction / exponential-absorption technique and the glass tint color.
   Reimplemented with this project's own naming and structure.

6. Audio samples
   Files: resources/sounds/burst.mp3, resources/sounds/burstSound.mp3,
   resources/sounds/metaball.mp3
   Source: Pixabay (https://pixabay.com)
   License: Pixabay Content License (free for commercial and non-commercial use,
   no attribution required; credited here as a courtesy)